[14379]="70030F84\n1\tDefeat the láthbear, Swertríper\t\n2\tDefeat the láthbear, Swertríper\tSwertríper, has left the confines of his den in order to ravage the countryside of the Norcrofts.\n3\tCompleted\tThe hulking láthbear, Swertríper, has been put to rest. His deadly claws and menacing teeth will cease to threaten the farmers of the Norcrofts.\n",
[14380]="70042EAE\n1\tDefeat Thangol-ya\tThangol-ya can be found patrolling Southern Ithilien. You have encountered Thangol-ya and should defeat the beast for the good of the Rangers in Southern Ithilien.\n2\tDefeat Thangol-ya\tThangol-ya can be found patrolling Southern Ithilien. You have encountered Thangol-ya and should defeat the beast for the good of the Rangers in Southern Ithilien.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated Thangol-ya and the beast's warband.\n",
[14381]="7003F2F3\n1\tDefeat the Great Bull\tAn old, ornery ox, called the Great Bull by locals, can be found walking the lands of Lamedon's lush valley. You should defeat the ox, for he frightens the folk of Lamedon.\n2\tDefeat the Great Bull\tAn old, ornery ox, called the Great Bull by locals, can be found walking the lands of Lamedon's lush valley. You should defeat the ox, for he frightens the folk of Lamedon.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated the Great Bull of Lamedon, making the lands safer for the people of this area.\n",
[14382]="70035693\n1\tDefeat the High Knolls Blizzard\tThe High Knolls Blizzard can be found moving up and down the High Knolls area of Wildermore.\n2\tDefeat the High Knolls Blizzard\tThe High Knolls Blizzard can be found moving up and down the High Knolls area of Wildermore.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated the High Knolls Blizzard, earning the gratitude of the people of Wildermore.\n",
[14383]="70041396\n1\tDefeat Sorzúr the Lone Hunter\tThe Lone Orc Hunter Sorzúr wanders alone through through the Dead Marshes, disdaining any path. You were lucky to spy Sorzúr. Seize the opportunity and defeat him before he slips away.\n2\tDefeat Sorzúr the Lone Hunter\tThe Lone Orc Hunter Sorzúr wanders alone through through the Dead Marshes, disdaining any path. You were lucky to spy Sorzúr. Seize the opportunity and defeat him before he slips away.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated the Lone Orc Hunter Sorzúr as he crept through the Dead Marshes, in service of the Enemy. The fell hunter became the prey.\n",
[14384]="7004139A\n1\tDefeat the Orc Taskmaster Búrgoth\tThe cruel Orc Captain Búrgoth pushes his crew ever onward through the marsh, never taking a moment from their search. Stop Búrgoth and his Orcs before they find what they were looking for.\n2\tDefeat the Orc Taskmaster Búrgoth\tThe cruel Orc Captain Búrgoth pushes his crew ever onward through the marsh, never taking a moment from their search. Stop Búrgoth and his Orcs before they find what they were looking for.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated the Orc Taskmaster Búrgoth and halted his relentless scouring of the Dead Marshes.\n",
[14385]="7004423E\n1\tDefeat Tupûrta\tTupûrta can be found patrolling Talath Anor. You have encountered Tupûrta and should defeat the Easterling and his allies for the good of the people of Gondor.\n2\tDefeat Tupûrta\tTupûrta can be found patrolling Talath Anor. You have encountered Tupûrta and should defeat the Easterling and his allies for the good of the people of Gondor.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated Tupûrta and the Easterlings' warband.\n",
