[14388]="70035921\n1\tDefeat Varg\tYou have encountered Varg and his warband. He must be defeated if peace is to return to Balewood.\n2\tDefeat Varg\tVarg can be found roaming near the Orc roadway in northern Balewood. The Uruk leader, Varg, must be defeated before he can sow more havoc in Balewood.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated Varg and his warband.\n",
[14389]="70041AB3\n1\tDefeat Vilosh and his warband\tVilosh can be found roaming the fields between Thama Aklam and the ruins of Lornost. You have encountered the vicious Haradrim rider, Vilosh, and should defeat him.\n2\tDefeat Vilosh and his warband\tVilosh can be found roaming the fields between Thama Aklam and the ruins of Lornost. You have encountered the vicious Haradrim rider, Vilosh, and should defeat him.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated Vilosh and his warband.\n",
