[14394]="7003467A\n1\tCollect pelts from wolves (total: 8)\tWolves with warm pelts roam the Whitshaws. You should kill wolves and skin them for their warm pelts.\n2\tBring the pelts to Léofburg\tLéofburg can be found at the refugee camp in the Whitshaws, south-west of Dunfast. You should bring the pelts to Léofburg.\n",
[14395]="7001AAD0\n1\tCollect obsidian gems (total: 5)\tShards of Twilight can be found around Minas Gîl, east of Ost Galadh. Agorin has asked you to gather some aspect of the Shards of Twilight outside Minas Gîl.\n2\tTalk to Agorin at Ost Galadh\tAgorin is at Ost Galadh, west of Minas Gîl. You should bring the obsidian gems back to Agorin for her study.\n",
[14396]="7000ACE2\n1\tPresent your Warden's Sceptre to Cannasgam at Tinnudir\030Craft a Warden's Sceptre (quantity: see journal)\tCannasgam is at Tinnudir in Evendim. Cannasgam has asked you to forge a Warden's Sceptre and bring it to her.\n",
[14397]="700174F1\n1\tTalk to Sadreda at the Foundations of Stone\tSadreda is at the Foundations of Stone in Moria. You have been directed to speak with the great warden Sadreda.\n2\tTalk to Sadreda at the Foundations of Stone\tSadreda is at the Foundations of Stone in Moria. You have been directed to speak with the great warden Sadreda.\n",
[14398]="7001792A\n1\tMeet Hrotha for further Warden training\tHrotha is in Ost Guruth in the Lone-lands. You have been told to speak with Hrotha, a Warden of great fame and skill.\n2\tTalk to Hrotha at Ost Guruth\tHrotha is in Ost Guruth in the Lone-lands. You have been told to speak with Hrotha, a Warden of great fame and skill.\n",
[14399]="700247AE\n1\tDeliver the broken halberds to Eirieniel at the ranger camp in Annúminas\030Collect broken halberds (total: 10)\tYou have accepted a task to collect broken halberds from the Angmarim infesting the city of Annúminas and deliver them to Eirieniel at the Ranger-camp within the city.\n",
[14400]="700247A3\n1\tDeliver the broken longswords to Astiul at the Ranger-outpost of Tinnudir\030Collect broken longswords (total: 10)\tYou have been tasked with collecting broken longswords from the brigands and goblins at Tyrn Fornech, north of Tinnudir, or to the south near Annúminas. You are to deliver the items to the Ranger Astiul within the lakeside outpost.\n",
